    "title": "CLAIR OBSCUR: EXPEDITION 33",
    "markdown": "# CLAIR OBSCUR: EXPEDITION 33\r\n# COMPLETE 30-EPISODE 100% PLAYTHROUGH GUIDE\r\n# NEW GAME+ — EXPERT MODE\r\n\r\n**Game version used:** 1.5.5 (Thank You Update 1.5.0 + anniversary cosmetics).  \r\n**Research date:** 6 September 2026.  \r\n**Rule:** everything reasonably possible is finished **before** the Lumière finale. Episode 29 proves it. Episode 30 is the finale.\r\n\r\nSupporting research lives in `/research`. If a line is marked **VERIFY IN GAME**, a source conflict was not fully resolved — do the action anyway and trust what the current build shows.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## How to use this guide\r\n\r\n1. Open the episode that matches where you are.\r\n2. Follow the `WALKTHROUGH` checklists in order. Every line starts from an Expedition Flag or a named Continent landmark.\r\n3. When you see **GET NOW** vs **RETURN LATER**, the later episode is already scheduled. Do not invent your own cleanup pass.\r\n4. **⚠ MISSABLE** lines are never buried in a paragraph.\r\n5. Camp when the episode says CAMP. Relationship ranks do not happen automatically.\r\n6. Skip generic material farming. Colour of Lumina on the ground is picked up when we walk past it. Do not grind.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## NG+ Expert in one page\r\n\r\nYou already have the toys. Journals, records, Lost Gestrals, Paint Break, Esquie rocks, relationships, and quest items have reset. Re-collect them.\r\n\r\nEquip **Cheater** and **Painted Power** as Luminas on every character from Episode 1 if they carried over. If Painted Power is not yet learned as a Lumina on a character, park the Picto on them until it is.\r\n\r\nFestival Tokens in Episode 1: **Old Key** and **Weird Pictos** are mandatory. Skip the Bun haircut if you already own it and keep the token.\r\n\r\nDifficulty tags: Comfortable / Strong Build / Optimized / Endgame / Superboss. These replace first-play level recommendations.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Traversal at a glance\r\n\r\n| Unlock | When | Episode that spends it |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| Esquie mount + smash rocks | After Esquie's Nest | 7–9 |\r\n| Swim (Florrie) | After Lampmaster | 10–11 |\r\n| Paint Break (4 Gestrals) | After Forgotten Battlefield exit | 12 |\r\n| Coral (Dorie) | After Old Lumière | 15–20 |\r\n| Fly (Soarrie) | After Paintress | 21–24 |\r\n| Dive (Urrie, Esquie rank 6) | Act III camp + Francois 1v1 | 25–27 |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Episode index\r\n\r\n| # | File | Title |\r\n|---|---|---|\r\n| 1 | [01-lumiere-the-gommage.md](01-lumiere-the-gommage.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 1 — Lumière: The Gommage |\r\n| 2 | [02-spring-meadows.md](02-spring-meadows.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 2 — Spring Meadows |\r\n| 3 | [03-flying-waters.md](03-flying-waters.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 3 — Flying Waters |\r\n| 4 | [04-ancient-sanctuary.md](04-ancient-sanctuary.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 4 — Ancient Sanctuary |\r\n| 5 | [05-gestral-village.md](05-gestral-village.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 5 — Gestral Village |\r\n| 6 | [06-esquies-nest.md](06-esquies-nest.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 6 — Esquie’s Nest |\r\n| 7 | [07-exploration-with-esquie.md](07-exploration-with-esquie.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 7 — Exploration With Esquie |\r\n| 8 | [08-yellow-harvest-lost-woods.md](08-yellow-harvest-lost-woods.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 8 — Yellow Harvest, Lost Woods & Side Areas |\r\n| 9 | [09-stone-wave-cliffs.md](09-stone-wave-cliffs.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 9 — Stone Wave Cliffs |\r\n| 10 | [10-exploring-the-waters.md](10-exploring-the-waters.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 10 — Exploring the Waters |\r\n| 11 | [11-forgotten-battlefield.md](11-forgotten-battlefield.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 11 — Forgotten Battlefield |\r\n| 12 | [12-paint-spike-backtrack.md](12-paint-spike-backtrack.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 12 — Paint Spike Backtrack |\r\n| 13 | [13-monocos-station.md](13-monocos-station.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 13 — Monoco’s Station |\r\n| 14 | [14-old-lumiere.md](14-old-lumiere.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 14 — Old Lumière |\r\n| 15 | [15-act-ii-side-area-sweep.md](15-act-ii-side-area-sweep.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 15 — Act II Side-Area Sweep |\r\n| 16 | [16-sirene.md](16-sirene.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 16 — Sirène |\r\n| 17 | [17-visages.md](17-visages.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 17 — Visages |\r\n| 18 | [18-before-the-monolith.md](18-before-the-monolith.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 18 — Before the Monolith |\r\n| 19 | [19-the-monolith.md](19-the-monolith.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 19 — The Monolith |\r\n| 20 | [20-the-monolith-peak.md](20-the-monolith-peak.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 20 — The Monolith: Peak |\r\n| 21 | [21-esquie-can-fly.md](21-esquie-can-fly.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 21 — ESQUIE CAN FLY! |\r\n| 22 | [22-flying-areas-i.md](22-flying-areas-i.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 22 — Flying Areas I |\r\n| 23 | [23-flying-areas-ii.md](23-flying-areas-ii.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 23 — Flying Areas II |\r\n| 24 | [24-the-hardest-side-areas.md](24-the-hardest-side-areas.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 24 — The Hardest Side Areas |\r\n| 25 | [25-esquie-goes-underwater.md](25-esquie-goes-underwater.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 25 — Esquie Goes UNDERWATER |\r\n| 26 | [26-versos-drafts.md](26-versos-drafts.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 26 — Verso’s Drafts \\| Thank You Update |\r\n| 27 | [27-versos-drafts-100-superbosses.md](27-versos-drafts-100-superbosses.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 27 — Verso’s Drafts 100% + Superbosses |\r\n| 28 | [28-endless-tower-thank-you-superbosses.md](28-endless-tower-thank-you-superbosses.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 28 — Endless Tower + Thank You Superbosses |\r\n| 29 | [29-the-100-cleanup.md](29-the-100-cleanup.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 29 — THE 100% CLEANUP |\r\n| 30 | [30-finale.md](30-finale.md) | Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 30 — Finale |\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## Missable shortlist (read once)\r\n\r\n1. **Old Key** — Episode 1, Colette. 1.5.0 adds a finale fallback. Buy it anyway.\r\n2. **Lumière Mime / A Peculiar Encounter** — Episode 1. Record can be recovered in Episode 30; the achievement cannot.\r\n3. **Trash-can Man** — Episode 1. Unlocks a Perfect catalyst conversation in Episode 30.\r\n4. **Weird Pictos** — Episode 1, Tom. Needed in Gestral Village.\r\n5. **Lettre à Maelle** — camp after Sirène (Episode 16). Check up on the others.\r\n6. **Maelle rank 7** — Episode 22, choose **(TRUTH)**.\r\n7. **White Nevrons** — spare all except Chalier (kill on request). Blanche is Episode 23.\r\n8. **Gustave's Journal** — write it at Act I camps before Old Lumière.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## POST-FINALE REQUIRED\r\n\r\nOnly these cannot be finished before you walk back into Lumière:\r\n\r\n- Journal Expedition 60\r\n- Opera House Lumière record copy\r\n- Monoco skills Aberration Light and Creation Void\r\n- Our Drafts Collide\r\n- Trash-can Man Perfect catalyst\r\n- The ending itself\r\n\r\nEpisode 29 does **not** send you into Lumière to get them. Episode 30 picks them up on the story path.\r\n"
