    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 4 — Ancient Sanctuary",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 4 — Ancient Sanctuary\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nClear Ancient Sanctuary, buy the Goblu record, grab Lost Gestral #1 if you walk the Esquie's Nest column road (safe now), and leave the Gestral Village password run for Episode 5.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Flying Waters exit. Ancient Sanctuary portal in sight.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- 1,000 Chroma for Blabary. If you are short, sell nothing important — floor Chroma in Ancient Sanctuary covers it.\r\n- Sciel is not in the party yet.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Continent — Flying Waters exit\r\n\r\n☐ Do **not** enter Ancient Sanctuary yet.\r\n\r\n☐ Walk **west** of the Ancient Sanctuary entrance.\r\n\r\n# MERCHANT — Blabary\r\n\r\n☐ Buy **MUSIC RECORD — Goblu** for 1,000 Chroma.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Goblu\r\n\r\n**Area:** Continent  \r\n**Nearest Flag / World Landmark:** Ancient Sanctuary entrance, west  \r\n**Exact Directions:** Gestral shop west of the portal  \r\n**How Obtained:** purchase\r\n\r\n☐ Buy every **Colour of Lumina** he sells before anything else.\r\n\r\n☐ If he duels: accept. Merchant duels are finite. **VERIFY IN GAME** his exact stock beyond the record.\r\n\r\n### Lost Gestral #1 — optional now, mandatory by Episode 6\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Ancient Sanctuary columns\r\n\r\n☐ North from the Flying Waters exit, slight right toward the columns east of Ancient Sanctuary.\r\n\r\n☐ Northeast: unnamed portal (Esquie's Nest). Lost Gestral standing in front.\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** Esquie's Nest portal  \r\n**Nearest Area:** Ancient Sanctuary / Esquie's Nest  \r\n**Traversal Requirement:** none  \r\n**Exact Directions:** speak, invite to camp  \r\n**Recommended Collection Time:** now, or Episode 6 if you refuse to detour\r\n\r\n☐ Do **not** enter Esquie's Nest. No password yet.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Ancient Sanctuary Entrance Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Clear the entrance plaza. Sakapatate enemies.\r\n\r\n# NEW ENEMY — Sakapatate (Catapult / Robust)\r\n\r\n**Monoco Skills:** Sakapatate Estoc / Slam / Explosion / Fire (Monolith also has them — Episode 13/19)  \r\n**Important Attack:** body slam / cannon. Shoot the weak point if it opens.\r\n\r\n# RETURN LATER — PAINT SPIKE\r\n\r\nLog entrance spikes. **Episode 12.**\r\n\r\n☐ Enter the maze.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Sanctuary Maze Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate when you reach it (mid-maze rest).\r\n\r\n☐ Progress until you pass a building on the right with **blue lights** and brush-head statues on the left. This is immediately before the next flag.\r\n\r\n☐ **Middle path left**, between the two farthest statues, down to a lower area.\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 63\r\n\r\n**Area:** Ancient Sanctuary maze  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Sanctuary Maze / Giant Bell Alley  \r\n**Exact Directions:** between the farthest brush statues, lower centre  \r\n**When Available:** now\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Ancient Sanctuary\r\n\r\n**Area:** Sanctuary Maze  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Sanctuary Maze  \r\n**Reward:** **Chroma Elixir Shard**\r\n\r\nFextralife: after Robust + Catapult Sakapatate, left path to Journal 63; cage is on the ground above, right of the journal.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nTucked in a pocket behind two trees (first two locks sit near each other).\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nLeft of lock 1, attached to rocks.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nExit this pocket. Left path covered by vegetation, between two inactive Sakapatates. Rope down. Jump structures to the cage ledge. Third lock behind crates on the right, below the ledge.\r\n\r\n### Cage\r\nTake **Chroma Elixir Shard**.\r\n\r\n☐ Return to the main maze and continue to Giant Bell Alley.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Giant Bell Alley Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Ring / story bells as required. Side alcoves: Colour of Lumina, catalysts.\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL — Mime / Petank\r\n\r\nIf a Mime or Petank is in this alley (VERIFY IN GAME — some maps place a Sanctuary Mime here, others do not):\r\n\r\n☐ Mime: same Break rules.  \r\n☐ Petank: First Strike, kill before it flees, or herd it to its plate.\r\n\r\n☐ Story boss of the Sanctuary (Ultimate / Robust Sakapatate encounter — follow the bell path).\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Ancient Sanctuary guardian (Sakapatate)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Comfortable. Shoot the glowing core.  \r\n**Reward:** story exit toward Gestral Village.\r\n\r\n☐ Exit to the Continent / Gestral Village road.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Exact Location | Reason Blocked | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Paint Spikes in maze / alley | Ancient Sanctuary | Paint Break | 4 Gestrals | 12 |\r\n| Esquie's Nest interior | Portal by Gestral #1 | Story password | Gestral Village tournament | 6 |\r\n| Sakapatate Monoco skills | These enemies | No Monoco | Monoco | 13 / 19 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nGestral Village portal. Sastro appears at camp **after** you have spoken to Lost Gestral #1.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\nIf camp triggers after Ancient Sanctuary:\r\n\r\n☐ Write Gustave's Journal.  \r\n☐ Talk to Lune, Maelle.  \r\n☐ If you grabbed Gestral #1: from the campfire take the southwestern path toward the Curator, **left**, then **left** into Sastro's clearing.\r\n\r\n# RELATIONSHIP / QUEST — Sastro\r\n\r\n☐ Talk to Sastro. Reward for 1 Gestral: **Gestral Haircut (Maelle)**.  \r\n☐ Paint Spike next to him: **RETURN LATER — Episode 12** (Colour of Lumina).\r\n\r\n☐ Play **Goblu** and **Lumière**.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\nSkip. Next episode is town / tournament, not a spike.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Goblu  \r\n☐ JOURNAL — Expedition 63  \r\n☐ Paint Cage — Chroma Elixir Shard  \r\n☐ Lost Gestral #1 spoken to (or explicitly deferred to Episode 6 start)  \r\n☐ Sastro reward 1 if camp happened  \r\n☐ Ancient Sanctuary story complete\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nGestral Village. Tournament, merchants, Manor record puzzle, Journal 52, Sciel.\r\n"
