    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 6 — Esquie’s Nest",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 6 — Esquie’s Nest\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nClear Esquie's Nest, beat Francois, recruit Esquie, take Journal 66, confirm Lost Gestral #1, and stop at the cave mouth. Overworld smash-rock exploration is Episode 7.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Esquie's Nest portal. Lost Gestral in front if you have not spoken to him.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- Password from Golgra (Episode 5).\r\n- Bourgeon Skin in inventory if you killed the Flying Waters Bourgeon. You will use it in Episode 7, not here.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Continent — Esquie's Nest portal\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** directly in front of the portal  \r\n**Nearest Area:** Esquie's Nest  \r\n**Traversal Requirement:** none  \r\n**Exact Directions:** talk, invite to camp  \r\n**Recommended Collection Time:** now if still missing\r\n\r\n☐ Enter the nest.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Esquie's Nest Entrance Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Follow the only story path through the sponge / rock rooms.\r\n\r\n☐ Side alcoves: Colour of Lumina, catalysts. Take them.\r\n\r\n# RETURN LATER — PAINT SPIKE\r\n\r\nLog nest spikes. **Episode 12.**\r\n\r\n☐ Meet Esquie. He sends you to Francois.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Francois’ Cave Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. Rest.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Francois\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**Weakness:** VERIFY IN GAME (often none that matters)  \r\n**Important Mechanics:** turtle, ranged crystals.  \r\n**Dangerous Attacks:** multi-hit shell / laser.  \r\n**Recommended Party:** Maelle, Lune, Sciel  \r\n**Recommended Skills:** Maelle Last Chance → Virtuose dump if you own it  \r\n**Reward:** story; Esquie will join after the next scene  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Comfortable.\r\n\r\n☐ Return to Esquie. Recruit him.\r\n\r\n☐ A new path opens back toward the entrance.\r\n\r\n☐ On the **right** of the exit path: tents.\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 66\r\n\r\n**Area:** Esquie's Nest  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Francois’ Cave / Entrance  \r\n**Exact Directions:** post-Francois return path, right-hand tents, centre  \r\n**When Available:** after Francois  \r\n**Return Later Required:** No\r\n\r\n☐ Loot the tent camp. Exit the nest.\r\n\r\n☐ You can now **mount Esquie** on the Continent. Do **not** start the Yellow Harvest / smash-rock tour this episode unless you want a two-minute ride to camp.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Smash-rock Continent | Everywhere around the village | This episode stops at the join | Mount | 7 |\r\n| Paint Spikes in the nest | Nest | Paint Break | 4 Gestrals | 12 |\r\n| Francois 1v1 (dive quest) | Nest / instanced | Esquie rank 6 | Act III | 21 / 25 |\r\n| Swim islands | Ocean | No Florrie | Lampmaster | 10 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nSee Episode 7 header. Full list is in `research/TRAVERSAL_TIMELINE.md` section 1.\r\n\r\n### New Areas\r\nYellow Harvest, Twilight Quarry, Ancient Gestral City, Stone Wave Cliffs approach, extra Gestral Beach, smash-rock journals.\r\n\r\n### Lost Gestrals\r\n#2 east of Stone Wave Cliffs (Episode 7).\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Write Gustave's Journal.  \r\n☐ Talk to Esquie if he is at camp.  \r\n☐ Sastro: take **Maelle Gestral hair** if not taken.  \r\n☐ Play new records.  \r\n☐ Sleep.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\nSkip. Episode 7 is exploration. Next real spike is Yellow Harvest chromatics (Episode 8) and Lampmaster (Episode 9).\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Lost Gestral #1  \r\n☐ Francois dead  \r\n☐ Esquie recruited  \r\n☐ JOURNAL — Expedition 66  \r\n☐ Mount available on the Continent\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nSmash every legal rock. Lost Gestral #2. Twilight Quarry. Ancient Gestral City. Small Bourgeon. Gestral obstacle beach. Stop before Yellow Harvest's interior 100% — that is Episode 8.\r\n"
