    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 10 — Exploring the Waters",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 10 — Exploring the Waters\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nSpend swim. Take every island that does **not** require coral. Grab Gustave's record. Fourth Gestral is **not** this episode (it sits after Forgotten Battlefield). Do **not** enter Forgotten Battlefield.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Stone Wave Cliffs. Esquie can swim.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- If a coral wall stops a lane, skip that island. Episode 15.\r\n- Coastal Cave Gestral: Game8 says swim; IGN says coral. **Check now.** If you can land on the orange island, take Gestral #5. If not, Episode 15.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### Gustave's record\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — north face of Stone Wave Cliffs\r\n\r\n☐ There is a rear entrance onto the Lampmaster cliff. Use it. Do not replay the whole dungeon.\r\n\r\n☐ Walk to the cliff where the post-boss scene played.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Gustave\r\n\r\n**Area:** Stone Wave Cliffs (post-story)  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Basalt Waves (if you warp inside) / north cliff entrance  \r\n**Exact Directions:** boss room cliff  \r\n**How Obtained:** pickup after Act I scenes\r\n\r\n☐ Play it at the next camp. Always.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### White Tree + Lost Gestral #3\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — swim west around Lost Woods, then southwest\r\n\r\n☐ Dock the yellow-tree island west of Yellow Harvest.\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — White Tree\r\n\r\n**First Available:** swim  \r\n**Recommended Time:** now  \r\n**Difficulty:** Comfortable\r\n\r\n☐ Centre of the area:\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Honeymoon in Lumière\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 36\r\n\r\n**Both:** middle of White Tree.\r\n\r\n☐ Exit. From the White Tree **portal**, walk **southwest**. Gestral by a vase / tall grass.\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** White Tree island  \r\n**Nearest Area:** White Tree  \r\n**Traversal:** Swim  \r\n**Exact Directions:** SW of the portal, vase, tall grass  \r\n**Recommended Collection Time:** now\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### The Meadows\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — swim to The Meadows portal (south of the new islands)\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — The Meadows\r\n\r\n**First Available:** swim  \r\n**Recommended Time:** now\r\n\r\n☐ Right side of the area:\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Our Painted Family\r\n\r\n☐ Shore **south** of The Meadows, abandoned camp:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 64\r\n\r\n**Area:** Continent shore S of The Meadows  \r\n**Exact Directions:** swim to the camp in the middle of the tents\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Blades' Graveyard\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Blades' Graveyard portal (swim)\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Blades’ Graveyard\r\n\r\n☐ Centre:\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Révérance\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Boat Graveyard\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Boat Graveyard portal\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Boat Graveyard\r\n\r\n☐ Centre:\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Alicia’s Birthday Party\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Gestral Beach — raft volley\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — second Gestral Beach (now swim-reachable if it was not before)\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Gestral Beach (volley)\r\n\r\n**Why now:** Game 2 of 5.\r\n\r\n☐ Melee the baby Gestrals back. Attack is delayed and is a cone. Do not spam on the third difficulty.\r\n\r\n☐ Beat all three difficulties.\r\n\r\n☐ Rewards: Resplendent Chroma Catalyst; **Swimsuit II (Lune)**; **Swimsuit II (Sciel)**.\r\n\r\n☐ If Expert timing makes rank 3 miserable, you may leave rank 3 for Episode 29. The trophy does not require the final outfit according to PowerPyx — we still want the outfit.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Painting Workshop — visit 1\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Painting Workshop portal (now reachable)\r\n\r\n☐ Platform down to the Faceless Boy on the large painting. Agree to help. **Light of the Beast**.\r\n\r\n☐ Platform to the Lampmaster statue. Place the item.\r\n\r\n☐ Falling off resets you to the entrance.\r\n\r\n☐ Exit through the painting past the statue. Visit 2 is Episode 13. Visit 3 (Lampmaster rematch) is Episode 24.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Coastal Cave check\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — orange island east of the Monoco/Old Lumière lane\r\n\r\n☐ If you can dock without a coral smash:\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** beach above Coastal Cave  \r\n**Traversal:** swim **or** coral  \r\n**If reachable:** take it now and mark #5 done.  \r\n**If coral-blocked:** Episode 15.\r\n\r\n☐ Do **not** full-clear Coastal Cave interiors if the enemies are Frozen Hearts-tier. Log the portal.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Sinister Cave / eastern water\r\n\r\n☐ If the lane is open and the cave is not coral-walled: you *may* take **Nocturne pour Lumière** now (right-hand grapples, drop the hole). If any coral blocks you, **Episode 15**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Lost Gestral #4 | Between FB and Monoco | Need Forgotten Battlefield exit | Story | 11 |\r\n| Lost Gestral #5/#6 | Coral islands | Coral | Old Lumière | 15 |\r\n| Painting Workshop 2–3 | Same portal | Story items | Later visits | 13, 24 |\r\n| Forgotten Battlefield | Story portal | Scheduled | — | 11 |\r\n| Paint Break | Sastro | Need Gestral #4 | 11/12 | 12 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nSwim list above is the content. Coral still closed.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Sastro: 3 Gestrals → **Gestral Haircut (Sciel)**.  \r\n☐ Play **Gustave** first. Then the new island records.  \r\n☐ Verso is the lead. Talk to Esquie, Sciel, Lune, Maelle if the game has opened Act II camp ranks. PowerPyx starts ranks after Forgotten Battlefield — if they will not rank up yet, do not force it.  \r\n☐ Write / open Gustave's Journal one last time if the option remains.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\nSkip. Forgotten Battlefield Dualliste is Episode 11.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Gustave, Honeymoon in Lumière, Our Painted Family, Révérance, Alicia's Birthday Party  \r\n☐ JOURNAL — 36, 64  \r\n☐ Lost Gestral #3  \r\n☐ Volley beach (at least ranks 1–2)  \r\n☐ Painting Workshop visit 1  \r\n☐ Gestral #5 if the island was open  \r\n☐ Forgotten Battlefield **not** entered\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nForgotten Battlefield. Dualliste. Journals 41 and 57. Then Gestral #4 and Paint Break.\r\n"
