    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 11 — Forgotten Battlefield",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 11 — Forgotten Battlefield\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\n100% Forgotten Battlefield, Dualliste, then the Continent strip to Lost Gestral #4 and Strabami. Stop before Monoco's Station interior. Camp for Paint Break if Sastro accepts four Gestrals.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Forgotten Battlefield Main Gate. Swim content from Episode 10 is done.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- Verso is in the party. Gustave is gone. Verso inherits the weapon collection.\r\n- Relationship ranks start after this dungeon (PowerPyx). We still talk to everyone at the post-FB camp.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Main Gate Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Clear the gate yard. Chevalière / battlefield Nevrons.\r\n\r\n# NEW ENEMY — Chevalière (steel)\r\n\r\n**Monoco Skills:** Chevaliere Piercing / Thrusts / Ice (Episode 13–14)\r\n\r\n# RETURN LATER — PAINT SPIKE\r\n\r\nLog trench spikes. **Episode 12** (same episode if Paint Break fires at the end of this one — still finish the dungeon first).\r\n\r\n☐ Main trench path.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Fort Ruins Expedition Flag\r\n\r\nReached by taking the path **up-right** immediately before Vanguard Point.\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. Loot the fort. Return to the main line.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Vanguard Point Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Meet the **Fading Woman**.\r\n\r\n☐ From her, **right**, then first **left**. Journal near a burning Nevron:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 41\r\n\r\n**Area:** Forgotten Battlefield  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Vanguard Point  \r\n**Exact Directions:** Fading Woman → right → first left → burning Nevron\r\n\r\n### FROM: Battlefield Expedition Flag\r\n\r\nReached by taking the **left** path at the Fading Woman split.\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Forgotten Battlefield\r\n\r\n**Area:** trenches past the Fading Woman  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Battlefield / Vanguard  \r\n**Reward:** **Chroma Elixir Shard**\r\n\r\nFextralife: behind the Fading Woman the path forks.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\n**Left** fork. Destroy the box stacks. Lock inside.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\n**Right** fork to the cage. Lock on the wooden platform next to the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nOn top of the trench wall just before the cage area. Face away from the cage and scan up.\r\n\r\n### Cage\r\nChroma Elixir Shard.\r\n\r\n☐ Passage behind the Fading Woman. Open area. Journal immediately in front before you go left:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 57\r\n\r\n**Area:** Forgotten Battlefield  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Battlefield  \r\n**Exact Directions:** through the passage, first open ground\r\n\r\n☐ Left to continue.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Ancient Bridge Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. This is the Dualliste arena approach.\r\n\r\n# BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Verso\r\nWeapon: best carried Verso/Gustave weapon.  \r\nSkills: Marking / Radiant / your S-rank kit.  \r\nLuminas: Cheater, First Strike, Painted Power.\r\n\r\n### Maelle\r\nSame carry package as Lampmaster.\r\n\r\n**Why:** Dualliste is a two-phase dual-wield wall. Expert strings are long.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Dualliste\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**Important Mechanics:** two weapons, phase change, long combos.  \r\n**Dangerous Attacks:** cross-slash strings.  \r\n**Parry/Dodge Notes:** if you cannot parry the full string, dodge the whole thing.  \r\n**Recommended Party:** Verso, Maelle, Lune/Sciel  \r\n**Reward:** story exit north toward Monoco's Station  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build Recommended.\r\n\r\n☐ Exit to the Continent. Do **not** enter Monoco's Station.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Continent — Gestral #4 and Strabami\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Forgotten Battlefield north exit\r\n\r\n☐ North. Under the fractured bridge to the right of Cruler and Jar Nevrons.\r\n\r\n☐ North past the first snow trees. Pair of **green-leaf** trees in the ice.\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** between Forgotten Battlefield and Monoco's Station  \r\n**Nearest Area:** Monoco's Station approach  \r\n**Traversal:** none  \r\n**Exact Directions:** in front of the two green trees. South of merchant Strabami if you overshoot.  \r\n**Recommended Collection Time:** now\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Strabami (north of the Gestral)\r\n\r\n☐ Buy **MUSIC RECORD — Lost Voice** (1,000 Chroma).\r\n\r\n☐ Buy **French Bob haircut (Lune)** if you do not own it.\r\n\r\n☐ Buy all Colour of Lumina.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP — Paint Break attempt\r\n\r\n☐ Talk to **Esquie** (rank 1).  \r\n☐ Talk to **Sciel** (rank 1).  \r\n☐ Talk to **Lune** (rank 1).  \r\n☐ **Maelle rank 1** is automatic when you **Go to sleep** after Forgotten Battlefield (PowerPyx). Sleep at the end, not the start.\r\n\r\n# FROM: campfire → southwestern path → left → Sastro\r\n\r\n☐ You have Gestrals 1–4.\r\n\r\n# ⚠ DO THIS BEFORE MONOCO'S STATION\r\n\r\n☐ Talk to Sastro. Reward 4: **Paint Break**.\r\n\r\n☐ Break the tutorial spike next to him. **Colour of Lumina x1**.\r\n\r\nIf Sastro will not give Paint Break: enter Monoco's Station only far enough to force a new camp (Episode 13 start), take the ability, then run Episode 12 before continuing Monoco's story.\r\n\r\n☐ Play **Lost Voice** and **Gustave**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Monoco's Station | North | Scheduled | — | 13 |\r\n| All logged Paint Spikes | Acts I–II | Ability just unlocked | Paint Break | **12** |\r\n| Duallist Storm | Dualliste | Need Monoco in the fight | Monoco | 13 return or Flying Manor / tower |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\n**Paint Break.** Episode 12 spends it.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ JOURNAL — 41, 57  \r\n☐ Paint Cage — Chroma Elixir Shard  \r\n☐ Dualliste dead  \r\n☐ Lost Gestral #4  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Lost Voice  \r\n☐ French Bob (Lune) if offered  \r\n☐ Paint Break **or** fallback noted  \r\n☐ Monoco's Station **not** completed\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nEvery Act I / early Act II Paint Spike, in flag order.\r\n"
