    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 13 — Monoco’s Station",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 13 — Monoco’s Station\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nRecruit Monoco. Take Journal 65. Do the Act I/II overworld skill sweep while the enemies are still the ones we already know. Clear Stone Quarry (Troubadour), Boat Graveyard if missed, Carousel record, Painting Workshop visit 2, Esoteric Ruins if you want Portier now. Do **not** enter Old Lumière.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Monoco's Station portal. Paint Break owned. Gestrals 1–4 done.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- Put Monoco in the active trio and **leave him there** for the rest of this episode.\r\n- Frozen Hearts request from the Grandis: accept, do not complete (Eternal Ice is Episode 22).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Ice Corridor Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. Walk the ice hall.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Monoco’s Station Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Story fight. Monoco joins.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** tutorial pack (Pelerin)  \r\n**Skill:** Pelerin Heal  \r\n**Location:** this fight  \r\n**How to Learn:** do not skip the tutorial if you want it now. Otherwise overworld Pelerins later.\r\n\r\n☐ Out the **back**, past the Monoco fight, **left** before the exit:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 65\r\n\r\n**Area:** Monoco's Station  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Monoco’s Station  \r\n**Exact Directions:** rear, left of the exit\r\n\r\n☐ Talk to the **Grandis** by the boxes. Accept the Eternal Ice request. **RETURN LATER Episode 22.**\r\n\r\n☐ Shop: buy Colour of Lumina. Survivor Picto appears only after Eternal Ice.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP (immediately after Monoco)\r\n\r\n☐ Esquie #3. Lune #2. Maelle #2. Monoco #1. Talk to Noco for the scene (no rank).  \r\n☐ Sastro: already paid for 4.  \r\n☐ Play records.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Overworld skill sweep — north of the station first\r\n\r\nKeep Monoco in the party. Ambush every **new trio**.\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — northeast of Monoco's Station\r\n\r\n☐ Trio in the snow: **Ramasseur Bonk**, **Cultist Blood**. Pelerin Heal if you skipped the tutorial.\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Painting Workshop / Carousel cluster\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — The Carousel\r\n\r\n**Recommended Time:** now  \r\n**Difficulty:** Comfortable\r\n\r\n☐ Flag. Hug **left** wall. Small cave:\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Le Grand Café de Lumière\r\n\r\n☐ SE of Monoco's Station entrance: trio **Demineur Thunder, Gault Fury, Troubadour Trumpet**.\r\n\r\n☐ NW of Painting Workshop: trio **Abbest Wind, Rocher Hammering**.\r\n\r\n☐ N of Forgotten Battlefield exit: trio **Cruler Barrier, Jar Lampstorm**.\r\n\r\n☐ E of Forgotten Battlefield exit, beach: trio **Cultist Slashes, Luster Slices**.\r\n\r\n☐ N of Boat Graveyard: trio **Potier Energy**.\r\n\r\n### Warp trick (PowerPyx)\r\n\r\n☐ Enter Forgotten Battlefield **rear** (Ancient Bridge). Warp to **Main Gate**. Exit the front. You are back on the south Continent.\r\n\r\n☐ N of Abbest Cave: trio **Lancelier Impale**. Finish Abbest Cave if you skipped the boss.\r\n\r\n☐ NE of Spring Meadows: trio **Portier Crash**.\r\n\r\n☐ Return to Monoco's Station. Use the **northwest** exit this time.\r\n\r\n☐ SE of a Gestral Beach: trio **Bruler Bash, Chevaliere Piercing**.\r\n\r\n☐ NE of that Gestral Beach: shop + path. **Right** before the enemy group:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 47\r\n\r\n**If you cannot find this beach yet (coral): Episode 15.**\r\n\r\n☐ Past the journal: **Danseuse Waltz**.\r\n\r\n☐ Centre crystal walker: **Hexga Crush**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Stone Quarry\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Stone Quarry portal (near Monoco / FB)\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Stone Quarry\r\n\r\n☐ Right of the Nevron:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 48\r\n\r\n# NEVRON QUEST — Troubadour\r\n\r\n☐ Left of the journal. Agree to help.\r\n\r\n☐ Dodge **red** notes. **Get hit** by **green** notes. Three sequences, length increases, order is random.\r\n\r\n☐ Reward: **PICTO — Healing Parry**. Spare the Troubadour.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Boat Graveyard (if Episode 10 skipped it)\r\n\r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Alicia's Birthday Party.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Painting Workshop — visit 2\r\n\r\n☐ Faceless Boy: **Colour of the Beast**. Place it on the statue. Exit.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Gestral Beach — ascension\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Gestral Beach (climb only up)\r\n\r\n☐ Top: **Swimsuit (Monoco)**. If the portal is still locked, Episode 15.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Esoteric Ruins (Portier)\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Esoteric Ruins\r\n\r\n**Difficulty:** Strong Build if the maze frustrates you. Can defer to Episode 15.\r\n\r\n☐ Flag. Talk to the glowing orb. It wants an item in the next room.\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Esoteric Ruins\r\n\r\n**Reward:** 4,990 Chroma  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Entrance  \r\n**How:** climb the mountain handholds, rope up, right path to the collapsed structure.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nFace the cage, walk back. Opening on the right, lock in the path crack.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nBroken building, far corner across the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nLower cliff right of the cage.\r\n\r\n☐ Maze: shoot orbs in **previous** rooms through open doors. Final door = orb in the **first** room through the middle room.\r\n\r\n☐ After the maze, **Wooden Boards** on the slanted building before grapples.\r\n\r\n☐ Return boards to the orb. **PICTO — Protecting Heal**. Spare it.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Frozen Hearts / Eternal Ice | Fly dungeon | Fly + difficulty | Soarrie | 22 |\r\n| Old Lumière | Story | Scheduled | — | 14 |\r\n| Remaining coral skills | Coral beaches | Coral | Dorie | 15 |\r\n| Journal 47 if locked | NE beach | Coral | Dorie | 15 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nMonoco skill system is live. Old Lumière is the next story beat.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Monoco\r\nWeapon: best carried Monoco weapon.  \r\nSkills: every Bestial you just ate. Put the ones that Break / heal / apply Shell on the bar.  \r\nLuminas: Cheater if you want him as a second carry; otherwise First Strike on Maelle and keep him as a skill sponge.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Monoco recruited  \r\n☐ JOURNAL — 65, 48, (47 if reachable)  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Le Grand Café de Lumière  \r\n☐ Healing Parry, Protecting Heal (if ruins done)  \r\n☐ Esoteric Paint Cage (if ruins done)  \r\n☐ Painting Workshop visit 2  \r\n☐ Skill sweep list above learned or noted  \r\n☐ Old Lumière **not** entered\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nOld Lumière. Old Key door. Renoir. Dorie / coral.\r\n"
