    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 14 — Old Lumière",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 14 — Old Lumière\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nFull Old Lumière: Old Key journal, Renoir record + journal, Renoir fight, post-camp rear journals/weapons, Paint Cage Redalim, Dorie / coral unlock. Do not start the coral island tour — that is Episode 15.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Old Lumière entrance. **Old Key** in inventory.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n# ⚠ MISSABLE\r\n\r\n**Fracture Survivor journal** requires the Old Key during the Maelle/Verso Left Street segment. If you skipped Colette, stop and accept you will use the 1.5.0 finale fallback — or reload a Prologue save. Do not rush this dungeon.\r\n\r\nThe party **splits**. Play every side path on **both** routes before the reunion.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Entrance Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. Story split begins shortly.\r\n\r\n### Lune / Sciel / Monoco route — Right Street\r\n\r\n### FROM: Right Street Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** first Chevalière pair  \r\n**Skill:** Chevaliere Thrusts  \r\n**Location:** Right Street  \r\n**How to Learn:** Monoco must be in this trio. He is.\r\n\r\n☐ Full Right Street sweep. Paint Break any spikes. Colour of Lumina, pictos.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Maelle / Verso route — Left Street\r\n\r\n### FROM: Left Street Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Forward. Giant sword in the street. Through the ruined doorway.\r\n\r\n☐ Immediate **right**: broken pipe / structure you can walk onto.\r\n\r\n☐ **Polished Chroma Catalyst** on top.\r\n\r\n☐ Drop through the hole in the pipe. Turn around.\r\n\r\n# ⚠ MISSABLE\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Fracture Survivor\r\n\r\n**Area:** Old Lumière Left Street  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Left Street  \r\n**Exact Directions:** pipe hole, gate, Old Key  \r\n**When Available:** now  \r\n**Return Later Required:** only if you have no key — then Episode 30 fallback key + a return trip, or NG++  \r\n\r\n☐ Interact with chroma at the pipe lip for a rope back out.\r\n\r\n☐ Rest of Left Street: pictos, chroma, story.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Reunion — Manor Gardens / Renoir\r\n\r\n### FROM: Manor Gardens Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ **Left** through the broken wall. Manor door.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Renoir\r\n\r\n**Area:** The Manor (Old Lumière door)  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Manor Gardens  \r\n**Exact Directions:** sinks in the bathroom you land in\r\n\r\n☐ Through the bathroom door, bedroom, table by the bed:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Renoir\r\n\r\n**Area:** same Manor bedroom  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Manor Gardens\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Renoir (Old Lumière)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**Important Mechanics:** painted father, gradient-scale attacks, party story beat.  \r\n**Dangerous Attacks:** cane / chroma waves.  \r\n**Recommended Party:** whoever the story forces; swap to Maelle/Verso if you can.  \r\n**Reward:** story. Dorie is found in the aftermath (Sciel / Esquie coral).  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build Recommended. Do not treat this like a trash elite.\r\n\r\n☐ After Renoir, you will be sent to camp before the rear of Old Lumière opens.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 58\r\n\r\n**How:** automatic after Old Lumière main.\r\n\r\n☐ Esquie #4 — unlocks **Verso Gradient: Striker**.  \r\n☐ Sciel #2. Lune #3. Maelle #3. Monoco #2.  \r\n☐ Play **Renoir**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Old Lumière rear (after camp)\r\n\r\n# FROM: Manor Gardens (re-enter via the **north / rear** portal)\r\n\r\n☐ Face the exit. **Right**: two new paths.\r\n\r\n☐ **Left** of those two. Rope down. Large sword. Past the enemy:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 42\r\n\r\n**Area:** Old Lumière rear  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Manor Gardens  \r\n**Exact Directions:** right of flag-toward-exit, then left path, rope, sword\r\n\r\n☐ **Right** path: grapples. Gold-sword enemy:\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** Gold Chevalière  \r\n**Skill:** Chevaliere Ice\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Old Lumière (Redalim)\r\n\r\n**Area:** Manor Gardens far lower right (after Renoir)  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Manor Gardens  \r\n**Reward:** **Redalim** (Lune)\r\n\r\nFextralife: new path, three Gold Chevalière, cage toward the left.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nOn the building on the path up to this field.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nBuilding at the end of the path past the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nEdge of the cliff past lock 2, building in the distance.\r\n\r\n### Cage\r\n# WEAPON — Redalim\r\n\r\n**Character:** Lune  \r\n**Obtained From:** this cage\r\n\r\n☐ Paint Break remaining spikes. Exit.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Coral islands / Falling Leaves | Ocean | Just unlocked | Dorie | **15** |\r\n| Lost Gestrals #5 and #6 | Coral islands | Coral | Dorie | 15 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\n**Coral break.** Full list in `TRAVERSAL_TIMELINE.md` section 4. Episode 15 spends it.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\nSkip unless Renoir humiliated you. If he did, Cheater + First Strike on the carry before Episode 16 Sirène.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ JOURNAL — Fracture Survivor, Renoir, 58, 42  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Renoir  \r\n☐ Redalim  \r\n☐ Chevaliere Thrusts, Chevaliere Ice  \r\n☐ Renoir (Old Lumière) dead  \r\n☐ Coral unlocked  \r\n☐ Coral tour **not** started\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nAct II side-area sweep. Falling Leaves. Both remaining coral Gestrals. Sinister Cave. Then Sirène.\r\n"
