    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 15 — Act II Side-Area Sweep",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 15 — Act II Side-Area Sweep\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nSpend coral. 100% every Act II side area that is not Sirène, Visages, or the Monolith. Take Lost Gestrals #5 and #6. Stop at the Axon doors.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Old Lumière **north** beach. Esquie can smash coral.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- Monoco in the active trio for every new beach pack.\r\n- Do not enter Sirène or Visages.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### Red island + Lost Gestral #6 + Mimes\r\n\r\n# FROM: Old Lumière north beach — swim northwest through coral\r\n\r\n☐ Dock the **red-tree** island.\r\n\r\n☐ Walk northwest. Two Mimes. Gestral behind them. Mimes do not aggro if you walk past.\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** red island NW of Old Lumière north portal  \r\n**Traversal:** coral  \r\n**Exact Directions:** south dock, walk NW, behind the Mime pair  \r\n**Recommended Collection Time:** now\r\n\r\n# MIME — Red island pair (optional)\r\n\r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build. Two Mimes is a long Break fight. Do them now for the cosmetics they drop. **VERIFY IN GAME** exact outfit names.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** beach trio on this island  \r\n**Skill:** Boucheclier Fortify\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Coastal Cave island + Lost Gestral #5\r\n\r\n# FROM: Old Lumière north beach — sail northeast, right at purple coral, southeast channel\r\n\r\n☐ Beach with a Stalact. Gestral between vases.\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** orange island / Coastal Cave roof beach  \r\n**Traversal:** coral (Game8: swim around — if you already took this in Episode 10, skip)  \r\n**Exact Directions:** IGN channel to the Stalact beach\r\n\r\n☐ Optional pack: Stalact + Ballet + Sapling.\r\n\r\n# WEAPON — Ballaro (Monoco), Saperim (Lune), Stalum (Maelle)\r\n\r\n**How:** this trio (IGN). Level 14 on a first play; NG+ converts/upgrades.\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Coastal Cave (interior)\r\n\r\n**Difficulty:** Strong Build. Clear it if the portal is here. Log any Paint Spike / Picto.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Northwest shop island\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — small NW island, Gestral shop\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 40\r\n\r\n**Exact Directions:** beside the shop Gestral.\r\n\r\n☐ Buy his Lumina. Merchant duel if offered.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** NW corner beach trio  \r\n**Skill:** Ballet Charm\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Western corridor beaches\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — west corridor, small beaches\r\n\r\n☐ Trio: **Moissonneuse Vendage**.  \r\n☐ Trio: **Braseleur Smash** (PowerPyx: Braseleur Smah), **Sapling Absorption**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Falling Leaves\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Falling Leaves\r\n\r\n**First Available:** coral  \r\n**Recommended Time:** now  \r\n**Difficulty:** Strong Build  \r\n**Why now:** two journals, two records, Scavenger.  \r\n**100% Contents:** Journal 35, 49; Alicia record; Until Next Life; Scavenger; Glaise skill; Manor door\r\n\r\n### FROM: Resinveil Grove Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** large walkers  \r\n**Skill:** Glaise Earthquake\r\n\r\n☐ Middle path, floating enemies. Journal on the **left** by the ramp:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 35\r\n\r\n☐ From the flag, right, ropes down to the **Lady of Sap** cavern. Left: Manor door.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Alicia\r\n\r\n**Area:** Manor via Falling Leaves  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Resinveil Grove  \r\n**Exact Directions:** table in the landing room\r\n\r\n☐ Talk to the **boy** on the right side of the area. Talk to the Lady of Sap below. Return to the boy. Gate opens. Rope up. Journal on the **left**:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 49\r\n\r\n### FROM: Scavenger Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Scavenger\r\n\r\n**Type:** Optional  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build Recommended.  \r\n**After the kill:** return to the boy.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Until Next Life\r\n\r\n**How Obtained:** boy after Scavenger\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Rederi — Robe de Jour\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — small round island NE of Old Lumière / directly south of Sirène\r\n\r\n☐ **MUSIC RECORD — Robe de Jour** for 1,000 Chroma.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### East island — Chromatic Reaper Cultist\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — east island\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 43\r\n\r\n**Exact Directions:** near the wandering Chromatic Reaper Cultist.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Chromatic Reaper Cultist\r\n\r\n**Type:** Chromatic  \r\n**Note:** flying — you must shoot to damage.  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Sinister Cave\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Sinister Cave\r\n\r\n**If you already dropped the hole in Episode 10, skip the record.**\r\n\r\n### FROM: Sinister Cave entrance\r\n\r\n☐ Right-hand paths to a ramp with a grapple up-right. (Left of that ramp: Chromatic miniboss — kill it.)\r\n\r\n☐ Grapple up. Turn around. Grapple across.\r\n\r\n☐ Left to a dead-end with a **hole**. Drop.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Nocturne pour Lumière\r\n\r\n☐ Right drop from the same upper area: dead Gestral merchant + a weapon. Take it.\r\n\r\n☐ Left from the flag: second weapon in the smaller wing.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Gestral Beach — race\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Gestral Beach (race)\r\n\r\n☐ Under **38 seconds** for all rewards: Resplendent catalyst, Grandiose catalyst, **Swimsuit II (Verso)**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Leftovers from Episode 13\r\n\r\n☐ Journal 47 if it was coral-gated.  \r\n☐ Ascension beach if locked.  \r\n☐ Esoteric Ruins if skipped.  \r\n☐ Hidden / Dark Gestral Arena: do early rounds if Comfortable; save Golgra-tier rounds for Episode 24.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Sastro: 6 Gestrals → **Gestral Haircut (Verso)** then **Colour of Lumina x3**.  \r\n☐ Play Alicia, Until Next Life, Robe de Jour, Nocturne pour Lumière.  \r\n☐ Sciel / Lune / Maelle / Monoco / Esquie if they have new ! marks.\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Sirène | East Axon | Scheduled | — | 16 |\r\n| Visages | West Axon | Scheduled | — | 17 |\r\n| Fly islands | Sky | No Soarrie | Paintress | 21 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nCoral list is spent. Axons are legal whenever you want — we do Sirène next.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Maelle / Verso / Lune\r\nFull carry package.  \r\n**Why:** Sirène is a long story boss with charm / dance mechanics.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Lost Gestrals #5 and #6  \r\n☐ JOURNAL — 40, 35, 49, 43, (47)  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Alicia, Until Next Life, Robe de Jour, Nocturne pour Lumière  \r\n☐ Scavenger + boy  \r\n☐ Race beach  \r\n☐ Red island Mimes (recommended)  \r\n☐ Sirène / Visages **not** started\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nSirène. Then the missable Lettre à Maelle camp before Visages.\r\n"
