    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 16 — Sirène",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 16 — Sirène\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\n100% Sirène. First Axon. Immediate camp for **Lettre à Maelle**. Do not enter Visages this episode.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Sirène entrance. Coral sweep done.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n# ⚠ MISSABLE\r\n\r\nAfter this Axon, camp and choose **Check up on the others** until you see Verso at the piano with Maelle and Esquie. That scene is **Lettre à Maelle**. PowerPyx: it can vanish if you skip optional camp scenes into the end of Act II. Do it before Episode 18.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Dancing Classes Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ First two groups of two enemies. Then a group of three with two large dancers off the platform. Journal on the **right**:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 55\r\n\r\n**Area:** Sirène  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Dancing Classes  \r\n**Exact Directions:** after the first two duos, right side by the trio / large dancers\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Sirène 1 (Shield Affinity)\r\n\r\n**Nearest Flag:** Dancing Classes  \r\n**Reward:** **Shield Affinity**\r\n\r\nFextralife: from the flag, down, left into the large arch, left, rope down, straight, stairs, left to the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nDirectly above the cage, on a pillar.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nBoulder to the left of the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nTurn around. Podium with the strange figure. Right, behind stone rubble.\r\n\r\n### Cage\r\n# PICTO — Shield Affinity\r\n\r\n☐ Large fabric room. Drop to the bottom.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** Bennisseur  \r\n**Skill:** Bennisseur Mortar\r\n\r\n☐ Floating elevator past the fabric room. **Manor door on the right** before you continue. Break the mirror: **Shape of Health**.\r\n\r\n# RETURN LATER — PAINT SPIKE\r\n\r\nLog Sirène spikes and break them now (you have Paint Break).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Sewing Atelier Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Sirène 2 (Revive Tint Shard)\r\n\r\n**Nearest Flag:** Sewing Atelier  \r\n**Reward:** Revive Tint Shard\r\n\r\nFextralife: from the flag, down, left into the arch, left when you see **Tisseur**, left again, climb collapsing floors, ramp to the ceiling, cage below the large thread.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nFace the cage. Right, round thread above Tisseur.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nKeep scanning right, up, lock on the ceiling cloth.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nWalk opposite the cage. Top-right, giant thread.\r\n\r\n### Cage\r\nRevive Tint Shard.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Tisseur (miniboss)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Optional / path boss  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build.  \r\n**Do the cage before you commit to the arena if the locks are in this room.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Crumbling Path Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Elevator behind the snake miniboss. Room before the next flag:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 67\r\n\r\n**Area:** Sirène  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Crumbling Path  \r\n**Exact Directions:** post-snake elevator, room immediately before the next flag\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Dancing Arena Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Rest.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Sirène (Axon)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**Important Mechanics:** dance / charm. Cleanse if you have Cleansing Tint.  \r\n**Dangerous Attacks:** long choreographed strings.  \r\n**Recommended Party:** Maelle, Lune, Verso  \r\n**Recommended Pictos/Luminas:** Cleansing Tint, Cheater, Painted Power  \r\n**Reward:** first Axon down  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build Recommended. Do not enter Visages until the camp scene is done.\r\n\r\n☐ Exit to the Continent.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP — do this before Episode 17\r\n\r\n☐ **Check up on the others** until the piano scene plays.\r\n\r\n# ⚠ MISSABLE\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Lettre à Maelle\r\n\r\n**Area:** Camp  \r\n**How Obtained:** optional camp scene after the first Axon  \r\n**Missable:** Yes — skipped scenes into the Monolith can lock it\r\n\r\n☐ Sciel #5. Lune #5. Maelle #5. Monoco #4 — **Monoco Gradient: Sanctuary**.  \r\n☐ Play Lettre à Maelle.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| Sirène's Dress (opposite entrance) | Other side of Sirène | Fly + Lune rank 6 | Act III | 21 |\r\n| Visages | Other Axon | Scheduled | — | 17 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nSecond Axon is all that remains before the Monolith.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\nUsed before Sirène. No second check.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ JOURNAL — 55, 67  \r\n☐ PICTO — Shield Affinity  \r\n☐ Sewing Atelier Revive Tint Shard  \r\n☐ Shape of Health  \r\n☐ Bennisseur Mortar  \r\n☐ Sirène dead  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Lettre à Maelle  \r\n☐ Visages **not** entered\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nVisages. Four vales. Verso record. Then the Monolith.\r\n"
