    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 17 — Visages",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 17 — Visages\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\n100% Visages. Mask Keeper. Journals 69, 39, Unknown. Verso record. Do not start the Monolith.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Visages entrance. Lettre à Maelle already obtained.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\nPowerPyx order inside: left-to-right side paths, Peak (Axon) third-from-left last. We do Joy → Sadness → Anger → Peak.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Plazza Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Merchant near the boss path: buy all Colour of Lumina, then extras. Duel if offered.\r\n\r\n☐ Side paths from **left to right**. Boss path is the one by the merchant — save it.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Joy Vale (first path from the left)\r\n\r\n### FROM: Joy Vale Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Path up-right: large enemy.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** Contorsionniste  \r\n**Skill:** Contorsionniste Blast\r\n\r\n☐ Lower main path trio:\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** Chapelier  \r\n**Skill:** Chapelier Slash\r\n\r\n☐ Left path. Ledge with two enemies, journal on the left:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 69\r\n\r\n**Area:** Visages, Path of Joy  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Joy Vale  \r\n**Exact Directions:** left path, ledge, two enemies\r\n\r\n☐ Paint Break / chroma sweep. Return to Plazza.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Sadness Vale (second from the left)\r\n\r\n### FROM: Sadness Vale Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Right path closest to the floating mask, up to a ruined camp:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 39\r\n\r\n**Area:** Visages, Sadness Vale  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Sadness Vale  \r\n**Exact Directions:** right path by the floating mask, ruined camp\r\n\r\n☐ Clear remaining sadness enemies. Return.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Anger Vale (fourth from the left)\r\n\r\n### FROM: Anger Vale Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ First path on the **right** into a cave. Right at the split. Manor door.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Verso\r\n\r\n**Area:** Manor via Anger Vale  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Anger Vale  \r\n**Exact Directions:** ground beside the baby grand piano\r\n\r\n☐ Next room, base of the bed, on a box:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Unknown\r\n\r\n**Area:** same Manor  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Anger Vale\r\n\r\n☐ Anger Vale combat sweep. Return.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Peak (third from the left)\r\n\r\n### FROM: Peak Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Rest.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Mask Keeper / Visages Axon\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**Important Mechanics:** masks, emotion phases.  \r\n**Dangerous Attacks:** long mask strings.  \r\n**Recommended Party:** Maelle, Verso, Lune  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Strong Build Recommended.  \r\n**Reward:** both Axons down. Monolith is legal.\r\n\r\n☐ Exit.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Sciel #3 and #4 (talk twice) — **Sciel Gradient: Doom**.  \r\n☐ Lune #4 — **Lune Gradient: Tree of Life**.  \r\n☐ Maelle #4 — **Maelle Gradient: Phoenix Flame**.  \r\n☐ Monoco #3.  \r\n☐ If Lettre à Maelle did not fire after Sirène, **Check up on the others** now. If it still does not play, **VERIFY IN GAME** before the Monolith.  \r\n☐ Play **Verso**.\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Location | Reason | Unlock | Return |\r\n|---|---|---|---|---|\r\n| The Reacher | Cliff west of Visages | Fly + Maelle 6 | Act III | 22 |\r\n| Monolith | Story | Scheduled | Both Axons | 18–20 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nThe Monolith approach.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Whole party\r\nPark **Painted Power** on someone if you still have not learned it as a Lumina — the Paintress is two episodes away and the Picto drops there if you somehow lack it. On NG+ you already have it.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ JOURNAL — 69, 39, Unknown  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Verso  \r\n☐ Contorsionniste Blast, Chapelier Slash  \r\n☐ Mask Keeper dead  \r\n☐ Gradients: Doom, Tree of Life, Phoenix Flame  \r\n☐ Monolith **not** entered\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nContinent prep and the Monolith door. The dungeon itself is Episode 19.\r\n"
