    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 18 — Before the Monolith",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 18 — Before the Monolith\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nLast Act II Continent check before we commit to the Monolith dungeon. Buy leftover merchant stock. Confirm missables. Do **not** climb the Monolith interior — that is Episode 19.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, between Visages / Sirène / the Monolith beach.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\nConfirm these are **done**. If any line is unchecked, do it now instead of \"later.\"\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### Missable gate\r\n\r\n☐ **Lettre à Maelle** is in the record list.  \r\n☐ **Old Key journal** (Fracture Survivor) is in the journal list.  \r\n☐ **Hexga, Jar, Demineur, Small Bourgeon, Troubadour, Portier** all spared and fully talked to.  \r\n☐ Sastro count is **6**.  \r\n☐ Paint Break works.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Continent — Monolith beach / door\r\n\r\n☐ Walk the beach. Colour of Lumina, catalysts.\r\n\r\n☐ Any merchant on this beach: buy Lumina first.\r\n\r\n☐ Petank / Mime on the approach: do them now.\r\n\r\n☐ Do **not** enter the Monolith proper except to touch the **Entrance flag** and leave if you want the warp. Prefer not to start Tainted Meadows until Episode 19.\r\n\r\n### Relationship leftover\r\n\r\n☐ Camp. Anyone with a ! gets a conversation. We should be at roughly:\r\n\r\n- Esquie 4  \r\n- Sciel 5  \r\n- Lune 5  \r\n- Maelle 5  \r\n- Monoco 4  \r\n\r\nRanks 6–7 are Act III.\r\n\r\n### Berrami\r\n\r\n☐ Gestral Village. Turn in every journal through 69 / 39 / Unknown / 67 / 55 / 43 / 42 / 58 / Renoir / Fracture Survivor.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\nNone. This episode exists so Episode 19 is a clean dungeon push.\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nMonolith interior (Episode 19).\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Maelle\r\nPainted Power Lumina already on. Cheater. First Strike. Medalum. Last Chance + nuke. Second Chance.\r\n\r\n### Verso\r\nS-rank opener. Phantom Stars if you use the Chevalam cheese later.\r\n\r\n### Lune\r\nHeal + Ice / Lightning stain kit. Cleansing Tint Lumina.\r\n\r\n### Sciel / Monoco\r\nOne of them in the reserve for Gradient battery.\r\n\r\n**Why:** Episodes 19–20 are a long no-exit story spine with the Paintress at the end.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Play any unplayed records.  \r\n☐ Sleep.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Missable list above all true  \r\n☐ Berrami current  \r\n☐ Merchants on the Monolith approach bought  \r\n☐ Monolith interior **not** cleared\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nThe Monolith. Three Paint Cages. Journals 34–35, 70. Then Peak.\r\n"
