    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 22 — Flying Areas I",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 22 — Flying Areas I\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nThe Reacher (Maelle 6 + **Truth** 7). Frozen Hearts 100% including both Paint Cages, Danseuse quest, Manor record, Family Canvas journal, Eternal Ice. Return the ice to the Grandis.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, The Reacher portal (west of Visages, fly).\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n# ⚠ MISSABLE\r\n\r\nMaelle rank 7: you **must** choose **(TRUTH)**. Lie locks the rank and the Gommage Gradient. Manual save before the camp talk.\r\n\r\nManor Family Canvas is in **The Canvas** side area. Grab it **before** or **during** Frozen Hearts so the empty frame works.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### The Canvas (do this first, two minutes)\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — The Canvas portal (fly)\r\n\r\n☐ Walk to the large painting. **Manor Family Canvas**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — The Reacher\r\n\r\n**First Available:** fly  \r\n**Recommended Time:** now  \r\n**Difficulty:** Endgame Build Recommended  \r\n**Why now:** Maelle 6/7 before we get lost in other dungeons.  \r\n**100% Contents:** Journals Unknown + 61, Orphelin/Echassier skills, Alicia flag, Maelle solo\r\n\r\n### FROM: The Reacher Entrance Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Humanoid drum-enemies: **Orphelin Cheers**.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Mountain Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Basket cliff enemies: **Echassier Stabs**.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Ladder Area Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Down-right. Manor door among burnt Orphelins.\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Unknown\r\n\r\n**Area:** Manor via The Reacher  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Ladder Area\r\n\r\n### FROM: Foggy Area Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Main path, platform immediately before the balloon:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 61\r\n\r\n### FROM: Peak / Alicia Expedition Flags\r\n\r\n☐ Story to the top. **Maelle solo** fight.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Reacher / Alicia encounter (Maelle solo)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Relationship  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame. She has her full kit.  \r\n☐ Exit the area.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n# ⚠ MISSABLE\r\n\r\n# RELATIONSHIP EVENT — Maelle\r\n\r\n☐ Talk. Choose **(TRUTH)**.  \r\n☐ Reward: **Maelle Gradient: Gommage** + Maelle trophy.\r\n\r\nIf you Lie, reload.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Frozen Hearts\r\n\r\n**First Available:** fly (full comfortable clear)  \r\n**Recommended Time:** now  \r\n**Difficulty:** Endgame Build Recommended  \r\n**Why now:** Eternal Ice, two cages, two records/journals, Danseuse.  \r\n**100% Contents:** Journal 51, Unknown (canvas), Clea! record, Anti-Freeze, Revive Tint, Danseuse quest, Gargant / Eternal Ice\r\n\r\n### FROM: Icebound Train Station Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Forward-left past caves. Train car you cannot reach. Large door. Journal in front:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 51\r\n\r\n### FROM: Glacial Falls Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n# NEVRON QUEST — Danseuse\r\n\r\n☐ Left, up the stairs, end of the tracks. Drop into white Danseuse. Agree to dance. Parry the 3-hit string, faster, many times. Retry is free.\r\n\r\n☐ Spare them.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Clea! Don't Pull Your Sister's Hair!\r\n\r\n☐ Right path into the cave (or climb path then down-right) to the underground. Large walker. Manor door. Record on the table.\r\n\r\n☐ Same Manor: empty frame on the **right stairwell** of the entrance. Place **Manor Family Canvas**. Far door opens.\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Unknown\r\n\r\n**Area:** newly opened Manor room\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Frozen Hearts 1 (Anti-Freeze)\r\n\r\n**Nearest Flag:** Glacial Falls  \r\n**Reward:** Anti-Freeze\r\n\r\nFextralife: right of flag, rope, grapple, broken tracks, climb right, turn, grapple levitating train, rope down, tunnel, right exit, left to cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nAbove the cage on the building.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nTurn around — crane.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nIce spikes left of the crane.\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Frozen Hearts 2 (Revive Tint Shard)\r\n\r\n**Nearest Flag:** Glacial Falls  \r\n**Reward:** Revive Tint Shard\r\n\r\nFextralife: climb the same structure all the way, left field behind the trains.\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nEye of the large Grandis statue, right of the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nPillar, from rubble left of the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nTurn around — train.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Iced Heart / Icebound Terminal Expedition Flags\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Gargant\r\n\r\n**Type:** Optional dungeon  \r\n**Reward:** **Eternal Ice**  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n# FROM: Monoco's Station — Grandis by the boxes\r\n\r\n☐ Turn in Eternal Ice. **Survivor** Picto now in the shop. Buy it. Buy remaining Lumina.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Endless Tower Stages 4–7 (optional)\r\n\r\nIf you still have time: Time Tint, Charging Critical, Critical Weakness, Fueling Break, haircuts. Else Episode 28.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\nFlying Manor, remaining flying side areas — 23/24.\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nSurvivor Picto. Maelle Gommage.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Maelle\r\nGommage is now the Simon/Clea button. Keep Gradient 3 for bosses, not trash.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\nAlready used for Maelle Truth.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Manor Family Canvas used  \r\n☐ JOURNAL — Unknown (Reacher), 61, 51, Unknown (Frozen Hearts canvas room)  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Clea! Don't Pull Your Sister's Hair!  \r\n☐ Maelle 7 Truth + Gommage  \r\n☐ Both Frozen Hearts cages  \r\n☐ Danseuse spared  \r\n☐ Eternal Ice turned in, Survivor bought  \r\n☐ Lumière **not** entered\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nThe rest of the flying side areas that are not Flying Manor / Simon / Drafts.\r\n"
