    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 23 — Flying Areas II",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 23 — Flying Areas II\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nEvery remaining flying side area except Flying Manor, Painting Workshop rematch, Renoir's Drafts, and Verso's Drafts. Blanche. Last Lost Gestral. Sastro Pro Retreat.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, airborne. Reacher and Frozen Hearts done.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\nWhite Nevron sheet must still be clean (Chalier kill-on-request is allowed). Blanche is this episode.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### Red Woods\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Red Woods portal\r\n\r\n# NEVRON QUEST — Benisseur\r\n\r\n☐ Glowing basin. Pour **5,000**, then **10,000**, then **25,000**, then **50,000** Chroma.\r\n\r\n☐ **PICTO — Recovery**. Spare it.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Stone Wave Cliffs Cave\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Stone Wave Cliffs Cave portal\r\n\r\n### FROM: Entrance Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Grapple, bridge. Right crawl, rope up.\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Stone Wave Cliffs Cave\r\n\r\n**Reward:** Chroma Elixir Shard\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nFace the cage at the cliff, turn around — above a broken airship.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nPath behind the cage — hexagon pillar in the distance.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nBeside the cage, facing off the cliff — another airship.\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 54\r\n\r\n**Exact Directions:** back of the area, Chromatic Hexga, journal on the ground to its right.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Chromatic Hexga\r\n\r\n**Type:** Chromatic  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Crushing Cavern\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Crushing Cavern\r\n\r\n☐ Defeat the boss blocking the path. Upper floor past the pickup you saw when entering:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 45\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### White Sands\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — White Sands\r\n\r\n☐ Back, by a boat:\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Aline\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### The Crows\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — The Crows\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 34\r\n\r\n**Exact Directions:** entrance, beside the flag.\r\n\r\n☐ Shoot all crows if you want the Chromatic. Kill it.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### East red forest + Forlorn + Chromatic Petank + Gestral #9\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — far east red forest (fly through clouds)\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Forlorn\r\n\r\n**Exact Directions:** south near water, Manor door. Wardrobe → secret room → record.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Chromatic Petank\r\n\r\n**How:** chase south through water to its plate. It summons fleeing Petanks. Stun them. Cheater helps.  \r\n**Reward:** **Anti-Stun**, Carreau Parfait.\r\n\r\n# LOST GESTRAL\r\n\r\n**World Location:** south of the path opposite Endless Night Sanctuary, north of the buried bell (IGN)  \r\n**Traversal:** fly  \r\n**Recommended Collection Time:** now\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Endless Night Sanctuary\r\n\r\n# FROM: Night Totem Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Left wall past the flag, climb.\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Endless Night Sanctuary\r\n\r\n**Reward:** Grandiose Chroma Catalyst\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nBehind boxes, right alcove after the climb.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nTree in the distance, left of the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nLarge structure across the cage.\r\n\r\n☐ Clear the rest of ENS (Chromatic / totem content). **GET NOW.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Floating Cemetery\r\n\r\n# NEVRON QUEST — Chalier\r\n\r\n☐ Left of the flag, pile of bodies. Choose a weapon (that is what you fight). It enters the building. Fight it.\r\n\r\n☐ It asks you to kill it. **Agree.** This does **not** void Blanche. **PICTO — Auto Powerful**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### The Fountain\r\n\r\n# NEVRON QUEST — Blanche\r\n\r\n☐ Second open area. If you spared the others: **Colour of Lumina x100**. If you murdered them: a fight and a worse payout.\r\n\r\n☐ Past Blanche:\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 84\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Gestral Beach — climbing wall\r\n\r\n☐ Middle path, dodge flaming orbs. Top: talk to the Grandis. **Swimsuit (Maelle)**. Gestral Games trophy if all five are done.\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 37\r\n\r\n**Exact Directions:** beside the exit.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Flying Casino\r\n\r\n☐ Up to the casino, walk around the **right** side.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Rêveries dans Paris\r\n\r\n☐ Door as **Monoco**: outfit.\r\n\r\n# FROM: Isle of the Eyes entrance\r\n\r\n☐ Rubiji: **MUSIC RECORD — Linen and Cotton** (1,000 Chroma).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Serpenphare\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — east, flying above White Sands\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Serpenphare\r\n\r\n**Type:** World  \r\n**Mechanics:** steals AP, then Rush + many shields. Shooting strips shields but deals no damage through absorb. After enough AP it explodes and stuns itself — dodge the explode.  \r\n**Reward:** **Energy Master**, Perfect Chroma Catalyst  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame. Maelle Breaking Rules / Sekarum / Barrier Breaker + Cheater + Last Chance.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Sastro: Gestral 9 → **Pro Retreat**.  \r\n☐ Play Aline, Forlorn, Rêveries dans Paris, Linen and Cotton.  \r\n☐ Confirm Gestral Games and Aiding the Enemy trophies.\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\nFlying Manor, Workshop Lampmaster, Simon, Drafts, tower late stages — 24/25/28.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Maelle\r\nEnergy Master + Cheater + Painted Power + Gommage.  \r\n**Why:** Episode 24 is Clea.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Journals 54, 45, 34, 84, 37  \r\n☐ Records Aline, Forlorn, Rêveries, Linen and Cotton  \r\n☐ Lost Gestral #9 + Pro Retreat  \r\n☐ Benisseur, Danseuse already done, Chalier, Blanche  \r\n☐ Both remaining Gestral games  \r\n☐ Serpenphare, Chromatic Petank  \r\n☐ ENS cage  \r\n☐ SWC Cave cage  \r\n☐ Flying Manor **not** done\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nFlying Manor. Clea. Workshop Lampmaster. The hard side areas.\r\n"
