    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 26 — Verso’s Drafts | Thank You Update",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 26 — Verso’s Drafts | Thank You Update\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nEnter Verso's Drafts (Thank You / 1.5.0). Natural first clear: Open Playground, Gestral Baths, Reverie Path, both Paint Cages, easier chromatics, Half-Baked Gestral, cake quest start. Do not skip easy pickups \"for Episode 27.\"\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, **east of Lumière**, dive / portal into Verso's Drafts. You are **not** inside the Lumière finale instance.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- Act III + dive required (official 1.5.0).\r\n- Endgame / Superboss pictos on. Osquio is Episode 27.\r\n- 1.5.1: Cannaro drops from Chromatic Machinapieds (Candy Land — Episode 27 if we do not reach it today).\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n# OPTIONAL AREA — Verso's Drafts\r\n\r\n**First Available:** Act III + dive  \r\n**Recommended Time:** now  \r\n**Traversal:** dive to the portal east of Lumière  \r\n**Difficulty:** Endgame Build Recommended  \r\n**Why now:** Thank You zone is finite and pre-Lumière.  \r\n**100% Contents:** 6+ flags, 2 paint cages, ~10 weapons, ~17 pictos, chromatics, Mime, cake, Licornapieds, Osquio (27)\r\n\r\n### FROM: Open Playground Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. Down the hill.\r\n\r\n☐ Left toward giant candy swirls. Between statues: **pink bubble** (Paint Cage analogue).\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Verso's Drafts 1 (Esquim)\r\n\r\n**Area:** Open Playground  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Open Playground  \r\n**Reward:** **Esquim** (Lune)\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nAbove the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nLeft, giant candy swirls, pink balloon on the **rightmost** edge.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nBack toward where you came, between two green-leaf trees.\r\n\r\n### Cage\r\n# WEAPON — Esquim\r\n\r\n**Character:** Lune  \r\n**Obtained From:** this cage (also listed as a Franctale drop on some pages — take both if both exist; extra converts).\r\n\r\n☐ Sweep the playground. Obstacle course. **Chromatic Licorne** at the top if you can do it now — otherwise Episode 27.\r\n\r\n# WEAPON / PICTO pickups on the playground\r\n\r\nTake every named item. Common Drafts weapons on this route: Esquiaro, Sucreso, Sucetton, Esquion, Baguettaro, Bonbim. **GET NOW** when you see them. Do not leave a glowing weapon for later.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Gestral Baths Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ NPCs / baths / Gestral conversations. **3 Pieces of Cake** quest: pick up every cake piece you walk past.\r\n\r\n☐ Merchant if present: buy outfits/hair you do not own. Duel.\r\n\r\n☐ Mime or challenge Gestral: fight now if Comfortable.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Reverie Path Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Chromatic Barbasucette\r\n\r\n**Type:** Chromatic  \r\n**Location:** near this flag  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame.\r\n\r\n☐ Grapple **west**.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Chromatic Franctale\r\n\r\n**Type:** Chromatic  \r\n**Reward:** Colour of Lumina, Grandiose x2, **Esqium** (Maelle)  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame.\r\n\r\n# WEAPON — Esqium\r\n\r\n**Character:** Maelle  \r\n**Obtained From:** Chromatic Franctale\r\n\r\n☐ Left of the **Gingerbread Door**: **Half-Baked Gestral / Romanifo**.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Half-Baked Gestral\r\n\r\n**Type:** Optional  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame.\r\n\r\n☐ Gingerbread Door: Gestral cannot open it. **You can walk through.** Do not ride the Licornapieds train yet if you want Episode 27 to own that fight — **or** ride it and stop at the station flag. Prefer: walk through, take Reverie side loot, **do not** start Licornapieds.\r\n\r\n☐ Past the gingerbread door, path up, colourful path, hug **left** edge. Cake door. Straight, fallen tree slightly right, walk under. Pink bubble.\r\n\r\n# PAINT CAGE — Verso's Drafts 2 (Chroma Elixir Shard)\r\n\r\n**Area:** Reverie Path  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Reverie Path  \r\n**Reward:** Chroma Elixir Shard\r\n\r\n### Lock 1\r\nPink balloon in the trees behind the cage.\r\n\r\n### Lock 2\r\nLeft, under red-leaf branches.\r\n\r\n### Lock 3\r\nPast the cage to the edge, purple wall between the yellow-leaf tree.\r\n\r\n### Cage\r\nChroma Elixir Shard.\r\n\r\n☐ Trains: right-hand train after Franctale is a door shortcut (Fextralife). Use it for routing, not for Osquio.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Return |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Candy Land / Chromatic Machinapieds / Mime / Cannaro | 27 |\r\n| Licornapieds | 27 |\r\n| Root of All Evil / Osquio | 27 |\r\n| Post-Osquio merchant | 27 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nRest of Drafts (Episode 27).\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Maelle\r\nEsqium if it beats Medalum for this zone. Otherwise keep Medalum.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Play new Drafts records if any (most Drafts rewards are weapons/pictos).  \r\n☐ Do not sleep into Lumière. There is no such prompt — just do not fly to the finale portal.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Open Playground + Gestral Baths + Reverie Path flags  \r\n☐ Both Drafts Paint Cages  \r\n☐ Esquim, Esqium  \r\n☐ Barbasucette, Franctale, Half-Baked  \r\n☐ Cake pieces you have seen  \r\n☐ Candy Land / Osquio **not** finished unless you overshot (if you did, keep using Episode 27 as the checklist)\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nCandy Land, Licornapieds, Osquio, leftover Drafts 100%.\r\n"
