    "title": "Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 27 — Verso’s Drafts 100% + Superbosses",
    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 27 — Verso’s Drafts 100% + Superbosses\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nFinish Verso's Drafts. Candy Land, Cannaro, Mime, Licornapieds, cake quest, Root of All Evil, **Osquio**, post-boss shop. If Simon was deferred, kill him at the start of this episode.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nReverie Path Expedition Flag, or Candy Land if you already walked there.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- 1.5.1 moved Osquio's red lifebuoy. If a pre-patch video disagrees with geometry, trust the current map.\r\n- Superboss kit on.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### Simon leftover\r\n\r\n☐ If Journal Simon is missing, go to The Abyss and finish Episode 25's Simon card. Then return.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Candy Land Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Chromatic Machinapieds\r\n\r\n**Type:** Chromatic  \r\n**Location:** Candy Land theme park  \r\n**Reward:** **Cannaro** (Monoco). 1.5.1 fixed the drop. If it does not appear, rest and check inventory.  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame.\r\n\r\n# WEAPON — Cannaro\r\n\r\n**Character:** Monoco  \r\n**Obtained From:** Chromatic Machinapieds\r\n\r\n# MIME — Candy Land\r\n\r\n**Type:** Optional  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame. Huge HP. Break, then dump.\r\n\r\n☐ Remaining Candy Land pictos, weapons (Licorum, etc.), haircuts. **GET NOW.**\r\n\r\n☐ Finish **3 Pieces of Cake** if a piece is here. Turn the quest in at the relevant Gestral. **VERIFY IN GAME** the turn-in NPC if the cake door / Osquio path is the gate.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Licornapieds Station Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Gingerbread Door → train.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Licornapieds\r\n\r\n**Type:** Optional / dungeon  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Endgame / Superboss if Expert strings are new.\r\n\r\n☐ Station loot. **GET NOW.**\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### FROM: Reverie Path — giant Esquie head\r\n\r\n☐ Back to the lower Gingerbread door. Look **right**: huge Esquie statue, long path, vortex.\r\n\r\n☐ Train up. Commentary. Through the vortex.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Root of All Evil / Main Field Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Flag before the stairs. Rest. Assign Gommage. Manual save.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Osquio\r\n\r\n**Type:** Superboss (Thank You)  \r\n**Location:** Root of All Evil arena  \r\n**Weakness:** none. Weak point: head.  \r\n**Mechanics:** early chunk of damage → belt-buckle spin heal **once**. Fists, Little Friends, Drop Kick, Pew, World Destruction.  \r\n**Recommended Party:** Maelle, Lune, Verso  \r\n**Recommended Skills:** Defenceless, Virtuose dump, Lune stain follow-ups  \r\n**Reward:** **Esquiso**, Perfect catalyst, Colour of Lumina x10, Grandiose x3, Recoat, Osquio Outfit (Verso)  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Superboss Build Recommended. Long HP. Do not spend Gommage on the heal window; wait until the buckle is done.\r\n\r\n# WEAPON — Esquiso\r\n\r\n**Character:** VERIFY IN GAME (listed as Osquio drop; treat as a unique Thank You weapon)  \r\n**Obtained From:** Osquio\r\n\r\n☐ After the scene, **Gestral Merchant** appears (Game8: after Osquio).\r\n\r\n☐ Buy **Osquio Outfit** and **Osquio Haircut** for Maelle, Lune, Sciel, Monoco if you do not own them (Chroma prices are high — 5,000 hair / 20,000 outfit on Game8). Verso's set came from the kill.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Drafts leftover sweep\r\n\r\n☐ Warp every Drafts flag. Empty every side path.\r\n\r\n☐ Confirm weapons: Esquiaro, Sucreso, Sucetton, Licorum, Esquim, Esquion, Baguettaro, Bonbim, Esqium, Esquiso, Cannaro.\r\n\r\n☐ Confirm both pink cages opened.\r\n\r\n☐ Confirm all Drafts pictos in the Pictos menu (Thank You additions). If a name is missing, walk the playground obstacle and bath roofs again.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\n| Item/Activity | Return |\r\n|---|---|\r\n| Endless Tower 8–11 | 28 |\r\n| TY portraits (Lampmaster, Duollistes, Clea Unleashed, Simon Divergent Star) | 28 |\r\n| Clea record | 28 |\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nSimon the Divergent Star portrait is legal if Simon is dead.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\n### Maelle\r\nSame Clea/Simon set. Episode 28 portraits are stricter parry exams than Osquio.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Play any new record.  \r\n☐ Confirm cosmetics.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Cannaro  \r\n☐ Candy Land Mime  \r\n☐ Licornapieds  \r\n☐ Cake quest  \r\n☐ Osquio + Esquiso + Verso Osquio cosmetics  \r\n☐ Post-Osquio shop bought  \r\n☐ All Drafts flags visited  \r\n☐ Simon dead  \r\n☐ Lumière **not** entered\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nEndless Tower to the top. Four Thank You portraits.\r\n"
