    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 28 — Endless Tower + Thank You Superbosses\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nFinish all 33 Endless Tower trials. Take the Clea record, Clair outfit, Ponytail, Visages outfit if missed. Beat all four Thank You portraits. This is the last combat episode before the audit.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nEndless Tower doorway, Continent west/NW of Gestral Village.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n# ⚠ SPOILER\r\n\r\nStage 11 includes Mask Keeper, Dualliste, Creation, Lampmaster, and **Painted Love** (Paintress + Curator). You asked for 100% before Lumière. We accept the spoiler.\r\n\r\nPrerequisites for portraits:\r\n- Chromatic Lampmaster — Lampmaster already dead  \r\n- Duollistes — Dualliste already dead  \r\n- Clea Unleashed — Clea already dead (Episode 24)  \r\n- Simon the Divergent Star — Simon already dead (Episode 25/27)\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n### FROM: Endless Tower interior\r\n\r\n☐ Confirm **Visages Outfit (Verso)** under the rightmost staircase (Episode 21). If missing, get it now.\r\n\r\n☐ Talk to the **Fading Woman** only after Stage 11 if you want her post-clear hair. You can talk now for lore.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Remaining trials\r\n\r\nUse IGN's list. Skip any stage you already cleared.\r\n\r\n**Stage 8:** Francois / Robust Sakapatate / Troubadour → Chromatic Boucheclier / Lancelier / Chapelier → Chromatic Glaise / Ultimate Sakapatate / Obscur. Reward: Empowering Tint.\r\n\r\n**Stage 9:** Chromatic Ballet / Eveque / Braseleur → Chromatic Demineur / Thunder Eveque / Stalact → Chromatic Danseuse / Flame Eveque / Frost Eveque.  \r\nEveques **shield each other** if not stunned. Reward: Rush on Powerful, Expedition White hair (Verso).\r\n\r\n**Stage 10:** Chromatic Demineur / Clair / Chromatic Portier → three Chevalière colours → Chromatic Chalier / Chromatic Jar / Obscur. Reward: Greater Powerless.\r\n\r\n**Stage 11 Trial 1:** Chromatic Moissonneuse, Mask Keeper, Dualliste. Kill Moissonneuse first, Mask Keeper, Dualliste last. Gommage the Dualliste.\r\n\r\n**Stage 11 Trial 2:** Creation, Chromatic Clair Obscur, Lampmaster. Clair Obscur first (silence). Shoot Lampmaster lanterns. Creation last. If inverted, do not heal — revive is fine.\r\n\r\n**Stage 11 Trial 3:** **Painted Love** (Curator + Paintress, shared HP and Break). Hit both at once to Break both. Gommage a marked stunned target.\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Clea\r\n\r\n**How Obtained:** clear all 33 trials (PowerPyx).  \r\nAlso: Outfit **Clair (Verso)**, Perfect catalyst, Endless trophy.\r\n\r\n☐ Talk to the Fading Woman. **Ponytail / Ponytail White (Maelle)**.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n### Thank You portraits\r\n\r\nBehind / beside the main canvas. Game8 Clea path: stairs past the canvas, grapple, **right**.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Chromatic Lampmaster (Endless Tower)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Thank You superboss  \r\n**Reward:** **First Life** Picto, Perfect + Grandiose + 20 Lumina  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Superboss. Lanterns plus chromatic HP.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Duollistes\r\n\r\n**Type:** Thank You superboss  \r\n**Reward:** **Duollison** (Sciel), catalysts  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Superboss. Two Dualliste-scale bodies.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Clea Unleashed\r\n\r\n**Type:** Thank You superboss  \r\n**Location:** portrait up the stairs, grapple, right  \r\n**Mechanics:** you do not get a turn / cannot damage her until a **full combo** is dodged or parried. A single miss gives her another turn. She can exile a party member with creatures of the deep.  \r\n**Recommended Party:** **solo Maelle** so exile cannot delete the carry.  \r\n**Reward:** **Cleim** (Lune), **Clea's Death**, catalysts  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Superboss Build Recommended. Parry exam. Immaculate / Full Strength.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Simon the Divergent Star\r\n\r\n**Type:** Thank You superboss  \r\n**Reward:** **Simon haircut** for Verso, Maelle, Lune, Sciel, Monoco; catalysts  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Superboss Build Recommended. Worse than base Simon. Same erase / 1-HP / double-swing rules plus new strings.\r\n\r\n# WEAPON — Cleim\r\n\r\n**Character:** Lune  \r\n**Obtained From:** Clea Unleashed\r\n\r\n# WEAPON — Duollison\r\n\r\n**Character:** Sciel  \r\n**Obtained From:** Duollistes\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\nOnly Lumière-instance items remain. Episode 29 audits. Episode 30 collects them on the story path.\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nNone. The map is done except the finale city.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\nNot after the portraits. You are ready or you are not.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\n☐ Play **Clea**.  \r\n☐ Confirm all Simon haircuts.  \r\n☐ Confirm Clair + Visages + Ponytail.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ 33 trials  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Clea  \r\n☐ Clair outfit (Verso)  \r\n☐ Ponytail (Maelle)  \r\n☐ First Life, Cleim, Clea's Death, Duollison  \r\n☐ All five Simon haircuts  \r\n☐ All four portraits dead  \r\n☐ Lumière **not** entered\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nThe 100% audit. If Episode 29 finds a hole, it tells you exactly how to fill it. Then — and only then — Lumière.\r\n"
