    "markdown": "# Clair Obscur: Expedition 33 — Part 30 — Finale\r\n\r\n## EPISODE GOAL\r\n\r\nReturn to Lumière. Walk the story path. Pick up the four things that only exist here. Finish the game.\r\n\r\nThis is not a cleanup episode. If you are missing Continent content, go back to Episode 29.\r\n\r\n## STARTING POINT\r\n\r\nContinent, Lumière portal. Episode 29 audit green.\r\n\r\n## BEFORE WE START\r\n\r\n- Monoco in the party for Aberration Light and Creation Void.\r\n- If you found Trash-can Man in Episode 1, watch for him in this district.\r\n- 1.5.0 Old Key sits somewhere in this finale area if you still need it. You should not.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## WALKTHROUGH\r\n\r\n# FROM: Continent — Lumière portal\r\n\r\n☐ Enter. This is the point of no return for \"pre-finale 100%.\" You can Continue after the ending.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Harbour Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# NEW ENEMY — Aberration\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** Aberration (first Lumière enemies)  \r\n**Skill:** Aberration Light  \r\n**Location:** Harbour onward  \r\n**How to Learn:** Monoco in the party, win\r\n\r\n☐ Story forward.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Central Plaza Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. Follow the story. Do not peel off into a 40-minute side tour — there isn't one.\r\n\r\n# ⚠ IF you found Trash-can Man in Episode 1\r\n\r\n☐ When you see the same shiny trash in this district, talk to him. **Perfect Chroma Catalyst**.  \r\nIf you cannot find him on the linear path, check plazas that echo the Prologue. **VERIFY IN GAME** the exact finale spot — sources agree he returns, not all name the flag.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Shattered Alley Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ At the **Opera House**, do **not** go inside yet. Go **right** to the path with an interact at the end.\r\n\r\n☐ Esquie brings the item.\r\n\r\n# JOURNAL — Expedition 60\r\n\r\n**Area:** Lumière finale, Opera House exterior  \r\n**Nearest Flag:** Shattered Alley / Opera House  \r\n**Exact Directions:** right of the Opera House, interact, Esquie retrieve  \r\n**This is the last journal. Follow the Trail.**\r\n\r\n### FROM: Opera House Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n☐ Past the flag, before you exit the building, **right**, by a closed door (ghost piano across the room):\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Lumière\r\n\r\n**Area:** Opera House  \r\n**How Obtained:** floor pickup (duplicate of the Prologue Mime record)\r\n\r\n☐ If you still need the 1.5.0 **Old Key**, search this final area now, then you would need a Continent return for Fracture Survivor — you should already have both.\r\n\r\n### FROM: Lumière’s Gardens Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate.\r\n\r\n# MONOCO SKILL AVAILABLE\r\n\r\n**Enemy:** large Gardens miniboss (respawns if you missed Monoco)  \r\n**Skill:** Creation Void\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Creation (Gardens)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story / miniboss  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Comfortable on this route.  \r\n**Reward:** story + Creation Void\r\n\r\n### FROM: Crooked Tower Walkway Expedition Flag\r\n\r\n☐ Activate. This is the last rest before the end.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — Renoir (Lumière) / final sequence\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**Important Mechanics:** the finale is a sequence, not one isolated elite. Play it.  \r\n**NG+ Expert Strategy:** Comfortable / Strong. You are overgeared. Parry anyway.\r\n\r\n☐ After Renoir, the painted soul / Young Boy choice appears.\r\n\r\n# ENDING CHOICE\r\n\r\n- Side with **Maelle** → fight Verso → A Life to Paint  \r\n- Side with **Verso** → fight Maelle → A Life to Love  \r\n\r\n100% does not require both in one save. Pick the ending you want. You can Continue and start NG+ later for the other.\r\n\r\n# BOSS — final party fight (Maelle or Verso)\r\n\r\n**Type:** Story  \r\n**Reward:** the ending you chose\r\n\r\n# MUSIC RECORD — Our Drafts Collide\r\n\r\n**How Obtained:** automatic after the final boss, either ending.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## After the credits\r\n\r\n☐ Choose **Continue** if you want free roam. You return near the last flag before the final fight.  \r\n☐ You do **not** need a postgame cleanup if Episode 29 did its job.  \r\n☐ NG+ is available at any Expedition Flag when you are ready. Journals/records/Gestrals/Paint Break/Esquie/relationships reset again.\r\n\r\n---\r\n\r\n## RETURN LATER CREATED\r\n\r\nNone.\r\n\r\n## NEWLY ACCESSIBLE CONTENT\r\n\r\nContinue world / NG+. Not part of this 30-episode run.\r\n\r\n## BUILD CHECK\r\n\r\nNone.\r\n\r\n## CAMP\r\n\r\nNone required. If you Continue, play **Our Drafts Collide** once.\r\n\r\n## EPISODE COMPLETION CHECK\r\n\r\n☐ Aberration Light  \r\n☐ JOURNAL — Expedition 60  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Lumière (Opera House)  \r\n☐ Creation Void  \r\n☐ Trash-can Man Perfect catalyst (if Episode 1 was done)  \r\n☐ Final bosses  \r\n☐ MUSIC RECORD — Our Drafts Collide  \r\n☐ Ending seen  \r\n☐ **Game complete**\r\n\r\n## NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW\r\n\r\nThere is no Episode 31. If you want another cycle, start NG+ and open Episode 1 again.\r\n"
